\section{Uncertainty}{

With \code{n_boot > 0}, each sample's paternal and maternal deviations are
recomputed on resampled probes (see \code{resample}), and percentile intervals are
reported for IDS (\code{IDS_lower}, \code{IDS_upper}) and Angle (\code{Angle_lower},
